{"file":"Noibu-v3.zip","bytes":196754,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"noibu","description":"Connects Claude to the Noibu MCP server"}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/accessibility-audit/SKILL.md","name":"accessibility-audit","description":"Audit a website for WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility violations using automated scanning and Noibu traffic data, and optionally draft the fixes. Use when you want to know what's inaccessible across the store, check WCAG or ADA compliance, find contrast or heading errors, audit for screen reader support, generate an accessibility report, or fix accessibility violations with pull requests or tickets.","headings":["Accessibility Audit","Setup","Rules","On-demand flow","Step 1 — Resolve and scan","Step 2 — Generate the PDF","Step 3 — Reply and deliver the report","Step 4 — Offer fix automation","Step 5 — Set up a recurring schedule","Scheduled flow","Configuration"],"name_hint":"accessibility · 审查"},{"path":"skills/build-business-context/SKILL.md","name":"build-business-context","description":"Builds a rich business-context Markdown file (a CLAUDE.md / context.md) so Noibu skills and Claude stop hallucinating and reason with real context about the business. Use this skill whenever someone wants to create, set up, or improve their business context file, onboard a new store to Noibu, 'build my MD file', 'make a context file', 'set up my CLAUDE.md', capture company background for the AI, or asks why Claude keeps getting their business wrong. Also trigger on looser phrasings like 'help Claude understand my business', 'document my store for the AI', 'what should I tell Claude about my company', or when a user is starting with Noibu and has no context file yet. Even if the user just says 'build the MD file' or 'set up context', use this skill. It does deep web research on the business (always via a subagent), interviews the user about goals, money leaks, deployment process, and team setup, writes a clean Markdown file, then persists the context to the Noibu backend for the domain.","headings":["Build Business Context (the MD file)","How this works, end to end","Test mode (fetch + persist only)","Step 1 — Resolve the domain and check for existing context (do this first)","Step 2 — Setup questions","Step 3 — Deep web research (always via a subagent)","Step 3b — Mine recorded calls (Gong / Fellow), if the user has them","Step 4 — The interview (conversational, in small batches)","Step 5 — Assemble the Markdown file","Step 6 — Deliver","Step 7 — Persist to the Noibu backend","Hard rules"],"name_hint":"构建 · business · 上下文"},{"path":"skills/checkout-analysis/SKILL.md","name":"checkout-analysis","description":"Analyze checkout performance and health using Noibu data. Use when you want to know where shoppers drop off in the checkout funnel, what payment or delivery methods customers are using, why completion rates are low, what priority errors are hurting checkout, or how cart and order values benchmark.","headings":["Noibu Checkout Performance & Health Analysis","How it works","Setup — before any query","Session tool — what it can group and filter by","Two principles that govern everything","Quick answer","Investigate click","Full analysis","Create live dashboard","Export PDF","Schedule report","Ignore issue"],"name_hint":"checkout · 分析"},{"path":"skills/product-analysis/SKILL.md","name":"product-analysis","description":"Analyze product and collection performance using Noibu data. Use when you want to know which products are underperforming, what your best-selling product type is, why a product isn't converting, how your collections are performing, which products get views but no sales, or where shoppers drop off in the product funnel.","headings":["Noibu Product & Collection Performance Analysis","How it works","Setup — before any query","Quick answer","Full analysis","Create live dashboard","Export PDF","Schedule report","Investigate click","Data quality notes"],"name_hint":"product · 分析"},{"path":"skills/querying-noibu-data/SKILL.md","name":"querying-noibu-data","description":"Required reference for calling `noibu_*` tools — field and measure semantics,   query constraints (the `orderBy` requirement, row caps,   unique-measure rule), the `rationale` argument convention, and domain   resolution. Also covers parsing of pasted `console.noibu.com` URLs.   Loads alongside topical Noibu skills   (e.g., `checkout-analysis`, `tech-diagnosis`), not instead of them — they   own routing for their respective domains.","headings":["Noibu MCP routing guide","Canonical Entrypoints","Before reporting \"no data\"","Sessions vs page visits","Lead with analytics","Domain Resolution Flow","The `rationale` argument","Query Constraints","Recovering URL parameters","Reporting blockers","Topic references"],"name_hint":"querying · noibu · 数据"},{"path":"skills/segment-analysis/SKILL.md","name":"segment-analysis","description":"Analyze segment and traffic performance using Noibu data. Use when you want to know which channels, devices, or countries convert best, how mobile compares to desktop, where your traffic is coming from, which segments are underperforming, or where to find your best and worst converting customer segments.","headings":["Noibu Segment Conversion Analysis","How it works","Setup — before any query","Quick answer","Full analysis","Investigate click","Save as Artifact","Download Report","Schedule Insights"],"name_hint":"segment · 分析"},{"path":"skills/store-pulse/SKILL.md","name":"store-pulse","description":"An instant, at-a-glance read on your store's health from the last 24 hours — with the option to save it as a live Cowork dashboard artifact or schedule a recurring report. Use to check on how the overall store is doing, save a live dashboard, or schedule a recurring summary.","headings":["Store Pulse","Default flow","Save as artifact","Edit an existing dashboard","Schedule report","Migration note","File map"],"name_hint":"store · pulse"},{"path":"skills/tech-diagnosis/SKILL.md","name":"tech-diagnosis","description":"Diagnose technical issues and Core Web Vital performance problems using Noibu data, and recommend a fix. Use when you want to know what's broken across the store, why an error is happening, what's causing errors, the root cause of poor page performance, how to fix a technical issue, why an error rate spiked, or where errors are concentrated.","headings":["Tech Diagnosis","Setup (always runs first)","Mode detection","Rules","Proactive mode","Tasks","Step P1: Scan for errors","Step P2: Scan for performance","Step P3: Rank findings and render widget","Fix (triggered)","Share with vendor (triggered)","Ignore issue (triggered)","Schedule scan (triggered)","Reactive mode","Connector check (runs once before diagnosis)","Stage 1 — GitHub and Chrome","Stage 2 — Shopify (only if GitHub is still unconnected)","Tasks"],"name_hint":"tech · diagnosis"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/plugin.json","skills/accessibility-audit/SKILL.md","skills/accessibility-audit/references/automation-nudge-widget.md","skills/accessibility-audit/references/platforms/generic.md","skills/accessibility-audit/references/platforms/shopify.md","skills/accessibility-audit/references/schedule-widget.md","skills/accessibility-audit/references/wcag-violations.md","skills/build-business-context/SKILL.md","skills/build-business-context/references/interview-questions.md","skills/build-business-context/references/md-template.md","skills/checkout-analysis/SKILL.md","skills/checkout-analysis/references/export-pdf.md","skills/checkout-analysis/references/live-dashboard.md","skills/checkout-analysis/references/queries.md","skills/checkout-analysis/references/schedule-widget.md","skills/checkout-analysis/references/triage-board.md","skills/product-analysis/SKILL.md","skills/product-analysis/references/export-pdf.md","skills/product-analysis/references/live-dashboard.md","skills/product-analy